      "text": "Motorsport as engineering laboratory: regulations create\nconstraints; engineers find loopholes; loopholes are closed;\nnew loopholes found. Technology developed for racing migrates\nto production vehicles (disc brakes, turbocharging, sequential\ngearboxes, active safety systems, hybrid powertrains).\n```"
