      "text": "DOWNFORCE ERA BEGINS (late 1960s):\n  1968  Lotus 49B: first high wing (also Ferrari, Brabham)\n        Wings mounted high on car for maximum downforce\n        Structural failures -> FIA bans high wings 1969\n        Wings relocated to bodywork (chassis-mounted)"
    },
