      "text": "ACTIVE SUSPENSION ERA (1992):\n  Williams FW14B: Williams + Renault + Newey/Head\n    -- Active hydraulic suspension: computers adjust\n       ride height thousands of times per second\n    -- Optimal aerodynamic platform always maintained\n    -- Also: traction control, ABS, sequential gearbox\n    -- Nigel Mansell wins 1992 championship by record\n       (9 wins in 16 races, 52-point margin)\n  BANNED: All driver aids (active susp., TC, ABS) 1994"
