      "text": "**Adrian Newey (born 1958)**: Aerodynamicist/designer responsible for more race-winning cars than any other single engineer. Career: March, Williams (FW14B, FW15), McLaren (MP4/13), Red Bull (RB6 through RB19). Red Bull RB series 2009-2023: 4 consecutive championships (Vettel 2010-2013), then Verstappen era (2021-present). His design philosophy combines aerodynamic insight with packaging efficiency -- fitting maximum cooling and mechanical components within minimum aerodynamic compromise."
